        <mxCell id="B8QQFRzXlDioX6YQd4wl-26" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=50;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.25in; text-indent: -0.25in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;93&quot; data-end=&quot;149&quot;&gt;&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New&quot; face=&quot;Zen Kaku Gothic New&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: -0.25in; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 50px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;反例探&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 50px; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;索のツールとRocqの統合&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Zen Kaku Gothic New&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 50px; font-weight: normal; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;現在、反例探索のツールとRocqでの証明が独立している&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-family: &amp;quot;Zen Kaku Gothic New&amp;quot;; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;今後は、探索で得られた反例をRocqへ自動で取り込む仕組みを構築&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-family: &amp;quot;Zen Kaku Gothic New&amp;quot;; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;し&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-family: &amp;quot;Zen Kaku Gothic New&amp;quot;; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;、&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-family: &amp;quot;Zen Kaku Gothic New&amp;quot;; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;証明をより効率的に行えるよう改良する&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
